{"steam_appid":1627570,"steam_name":"The Plucky Squire","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1627570/571242/624ea352618ff259f9929d2a343c8c499f3be40e/1750713273/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1684959760","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256948780/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1684959760","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/ss_7e133ae64cd9ca07f813d18d6a90d03add8dc44b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757545827","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/ss_f7471b779abf4af1f67792e625bccf3891b9e62e.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757545827","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/ss_32752877cbedc3fc6a9c75ed95afff17aa9f7b7f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757545827","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/ss_98e6a435fdf09b74d3bbe00d6919284d13ba3cca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757545827","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/ss_2c4b9f2614e2b4344ee7734649fe126550fe5c65.1920x1080.jpg?t=1757545827"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/808ad7efbf17d7d8fb5e44a41101b603.poster.avif?t=1757545827\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/808ad7efbf17d7d8fb5e44a41101b603.webm?t=1757545827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/808ad7efbf17d7d8fb5e44a41101b603.mp4?t=1757545827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Plucky Squire follows the magical adventures of Jot and his friends - storybook characters who discover a three-dimensional world outside the pages of their book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/4dfd826052267cadc68297554e2b7b8a.poster.avif?t=1757545827\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/4dfd826052267cadc68297554e2b7b8a.webm?t=1757545827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/4dfd826052267cadc68297554e2b7b8a.mp4?t=1757545827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the malevolent Humgrump realizes he's the villain of the book - destined to lose his battle against the forces of good for all eternity - he kicks the heroic Jot out of its pages and changes the story forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/e556329532b4489e45efeb717d3353b6.poster.avif?t=1757545827\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/e556329532b4489e45efeb717d3353b6.webm?t=1757545827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/e556329532b4489e45efeb717d3353b6.mp4?t=1757545827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jot must face challenges, unlike anything he's ever seen if he is to save his friends from Humgrump's dark forces and restore the book's happy ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/bc57846c0263084333b6c28b3bc38e4b.poster.avif?t=1757545827\" width=618 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/bc57846c0263084333b6c28b3bc38e4b.webm?t=1757545827\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1627570/extras/bc57846c0263084333b6c28b3bc38e4b.mp4?t=1757545827\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump between 2D and 3D worlds in this charming action-adventure - solving puzzles, boxing badgers, flying with a jetpack, and enjoying many more delightful and surprising mini-challenges as you become the hero of a living storybook.</p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4160 / AMD FX-4350<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 960 (4096Mb) / Radeon RX 460 (4096Mb)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 27 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Low Quality setting, 1080p, producing 40+ FPS</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64 Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600K / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1080 (8192MB) / Radeon RX Vega 64 (8192 MB) / Intel Arc A750<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 27 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> High Quality setting, 1080p, producing 60 FPS</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure"],"developers":["All Possible Futures"],"publishers":["Devolver Digital"],"release_date":"17 Sep, 2024","metacritic_score":83}